        "line": 72,
        "text": "theorem uncutVelocity_smooth {A B : ℕ → VelocityField} {U : Set SpaceTime}\n    (hU : IsOpen U) (hA : ∀ j, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (A j) U)\n    (hB : ∀ j, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (B j) U) (J : ℕ) :\n    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (uncutVelocity A B J) U"
